#
# The dedicated optional Knowledge Context broker is separate from the M.I.O.
# local runtime, remote inference, and artifact fetcher.
# It may use network address families only after commissioning; IPAddressDeny=any remains in force and this package supplies no IPAddressAllow entry; a deployment may add exactly one, derived from the signed registry peer by az-knowledge-context-egress.
# The local socket is restricted to M.I.O.
